'''Visa requirements for [[Brazilian nationality law|Brazilian citizens]]''' are administrative entry restrictions by the authorities of other states placed on citizens of [[Brazil]].

As of 2026, Brazilian citizens have visa-free or visa on arrival access to 170 countries and territories, ranking the [[Brazilian passport]] 15th in the world according to the [[Henley & Partners Passport Index|Henley Passport Index]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.henleyglobal.com/passport-index/ranking | title=Global Passport Ranking}}</ref>

